      <section class="shell contribution"><div><p class="kicker">My contribution</p><h2>Leading the translation from a lab need to durable research infrastructure</h2></div><div class="contribution-list"><p><span>Direction</span>Scoped the platform around repeatable HMI research rather than a one-off demonstration.</p><p><span>Coordination</span>Aligned six contributors working across Unity, networking, ADAS logic, interfaces, controls, and testing.</p><p><span>Integration</span>Connected system behavior and interface feedback into an operable physical simulator.</p><p><span>Impact</span>Established shared infrastructure that supported more than thirty subsequent lab tests.</p></div></section>

